          "file": "apps/home/server/connect/naming-ticket.ts",
          "why": "ap-town spec 431 — the naming gate signs claim tickets (EIP-712) with NAMING_GATE_PRIVATE_KEY after the domain rule; a ticket moves no value and confers no authority (the chain checks it; the treasury pays). Posture item: move the gate signer to KMS and rotate via PricedSubregistry.setGate."
        }
      ],
      "toleratedEnvNames": [
        {
          "name": "A2A_MASTER_PRIVATE_KEY",
          "why": "the local-aes dev backend signing key; unused under gcp-kms"
        },
        {
          "name": "A2A_INTERACTIONS_SESSION_PRIVATE_KEY",
          "why": "workstation-only InteractionsDO session signer when no Cloud KMS is present"
        },
        {
          "name": "NAMING_GATE_PRIVATE_KEY",
          "why": "ap-town spec 431 — the Home's naming gate signs claim tickets (EIP-712) with this key; it vouches for the domain rule, moves no value and holds no identity; rotatable by the subregistry governor (setGate). Posture item: move to KMS."
        }
      ]
    },
